                <pb facs="0662" n="574" sameAs="frus:frus1933v04/pg574"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">722.2315/749: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Peru</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Dearing</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Lima</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-08-24T11:00:00-05:00">August 24, 1933—11
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received 8:32 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>183. Foreign Minister informs me it has been agreed he shall endeavor to
                    negotiate boundary settlement with Ecuador with Ecuadorian Minister here
                    simultaneously with Leticia negotiations at Rio de Janeiro.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dearing</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
